OL,3,AThick fog to create hazardous driving
OL,4,Aconditions into next week
OL,5,
OL,6,FDense fog will blanket parts of the UK
OL,7,Fon Sunday and into next week, causing
OL,8,Fdangerous driving conditions.
OL,10,FEngland and Wales are most likely to
OL,11,Fexperience the foggy conditions on
OL,12,FSunday, before the threat shifts
OL,13,Fnorthwards into next week.
OL,15,FIt comes after the Met Office issued a
OL,16,Fyellow weather warning for parts of
OL,17,FEngland and Wales early on Saturday
OL,18,Fmorning and again on Sunday morning
OL,19,Fwith visibility on roads less than 100m
OL,20,Fin places.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
