OL,3,AThick fog to create hazardous driving
OL,4,Aconditions into next week
OL,5,
OL,6,FFurther warnings could be issued in the
OL,7,Fcoming days as the waning strength of
OL,8,Fthe late autumn sun means mist, fog and
OL,9,Fpatches of low cloud are slow to clear.
